# Root .env — developer-local overrides for agent workflows and app config.
# These are NEVER deployed and NEVER committed. Copy to .env and fill in.
#
# Nothing here is required. The workflow skills reach GitHub Issues and the
# Project board through the GitHub CLI, which holds your credentials:
#   gh auth login && gh auth refresh -s project
# See docs/development/github-workflow.md.

# --- GitHub Project board (optional) ---
# Only needed if more than one GitHub Project is linked to this repository;
# otherwise scripts/gh-workflow.mjs discovers the board automatically.
# GH_PROJECT_OWNER=              # User or organisation that owns the board (e.g. your GitHub login)
# GH_PROJECT_NUMBER=             # The number in the board URL: github.com/users/<owner>/projects/<number>
